{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S01\",\"screen\":\"明明清楚自己要说什么，正因为太清楚，知道一旦说出口关系可能改变，才格外谨慎\",\"source\":\"心里很清楚自己要说什么，正因为太清楚，又明白有些话一旦说出口，关系就会改变，所以格外谨慎。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿确定说出口关系就会改变，屏幕稿改成关系可能改变，降低了原本的确定性。\"},{\"sec\":\"S12\",\"screen\":\"也可以像久别重逢：刚才还能够微笑、寒暄，忽然却抱紧对方，久久不愿松手 / 喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，快乐到连自己想笑还是想哭都分不清\",\"source\":\"它也可以像久别重逢：刚才还能够微笑、寒暄，忽然却抱紧对方，久久不愿松手；又可以是喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润，快乐到连自己想笑还是想哭都分不清。\",\"type\":7,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将久别重逢和喉咙发紧、眼眶湿润作为两种并列的感受，屏幕稿删去“又可以是”，容易将后者理解成前一场重逢的后续表现。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d450a8a0-a7c1-449c-a964-5aef8e85a1a0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T082649492416Z", "elapsed_seconds": 217.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T08:30:26.643545+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bcab60731d289c341b6ec362952e1354619d254576e3b0e528e7633b815612ff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4